  "name": "flaky-test-fixes-skill",
  "description": "A diagnosis-first procedure for flaky tests in any UI or integration suite (Playwright, Selenium, Cypress, WebdriverIO, Jest, pytest): reproduce and measure, classify the cause, fix the cause, prove the fix. Use when a test fails intermittently, passes on retry, fails only in CI, only in parallel or only in the full suite, or when the user says \"flaky\", \"intermittent\", \"works on my machine\", \"quarantine this test\" or asks to add a retry, a sleep or a longer timeout.",
